S/O SYED NESAR AHEMD  NO.302, 4TH MAIN CROSS,
 HRBR LAYOUT, KAMMANAHALLI  BANGALORE-560 043 Smt Tintu Eldhose vs Bajaj All Gen Ins Co Ltd on 13 August, 2024 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/14371841/
3  ...RESPONDENTS (BY SRI.M.H.PRAKASH, ADVOCATE FOR R1 TO R4;
 SRI.D.VIJAYA KUMAR, ADVOCATE FOR R5;

ORDER (i) The appeal filed by the petitioners in MFA No.2067/2015 is allowed in part;
- 14 - Smt Tintu Eldhose vs Bajaj All Gen Ins Co Ltd on 13 August, 2024 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/14371841/
8 NC: 2024:KHC:32341 (ii) The appeal filed by the Insurer of the Honda Activa in MFA No.2336/2015 is allowed;
(iii) The impugned judgment and award is modified;
(iv) The petitioners would be entitled for enhanced compensation of Rs.10,81,776/- with interest at the rate of 6% per annum from the date of petition till the date of deposit;
(iv) Both respondents No.2 and 3 i.e., Insurer and owner of the Honda Activa are exonerated from their liability;
(v) KSRTC is directed to deposit the full award with interest within a period of eight weeks from the date of receipt of a copy of the judgment; and (v) The amount, if any, deposited by the Insurance Company shall be returned to it and Office shall transmit the same to the Tribunal for disbursement to the Insurance Company.
